---
---

<section class="mission section" id="mission">
  <div class="container mission__inner">
    <h2 class="mission__title">
      We help businesses grow<br class="mission__br" />
      by putting software,<br class="mission__br" />
      automation &amp; AI<br class="mission__br" />
      <em>to work where it matters</em>
    </h2>
    <div class="mission__copy">
      <p>
        Our mission is to give small and medium-sized businesses access to the
        kind of connected software, automation, and AI capability that's
        typically reserved for large enterprises.
      </p>
      <p>
        We integrate it into the tools you already run, point it at a growth
        target we agree together, and measure what it delivers — so technology
        becomes something your business profits from, not just pays for.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .mission {
    background: #fff;
    padding-block: clamp(5.5rem, 10vw, 9rem);
  }

  .mission__inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 6.5fr) minmax(0, 5.5fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 5rem);
    align-items: center;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .mission__inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .mission__br {
      display: none;
    }
  }

  .mission__title {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.8vw, 3.25rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1.16;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .mission__title em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .mission__copy {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .mission__copy p {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.2vw, 1.125rem);
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }
</style>
